  "id": "mashed-potato-cakes-with-bacon-and-cheese",
  "name": "Mashed Potato Cakes with Bacon and Cheese",
  "subtitle": "Crisp, savory potato cakes with a creamy topping",
  "description": "Mashed potatoes, bacon, cheese, and sautéed vegetables form tender cakes that are browned in a skillet and served with sour cream.",
